| UI Lambdaログ          | `/aws/lambda/<ui-function-name>`                                              |
| MCP Lambdaログ         | `/aws/lambda/<mcp-function-name>`                                             |
| Runtimeログ            | `/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/<agent-id>-<endpoint-name>`                  |
| Memory Vended Logs   | `/aws/vendedlogs/bedrock-agentcore/memory/APPLICATION_LOGS/<memory-id>`       |
| Gateway Vended Logs  | `/aws/vendedlogs/bedrock-agentcore/gateway/APPLICATION_LOGS/<gateway-id>`     |
| Identity Vended Logs | `/aws/vendedlogs/bedrock-agentcore/identity/APPLICATION_LOGS/<identity-id>`   |
| Bedrock推論ログ          | `/aws/bedrock/modelinvocations`                                               |
| Knowledge Bases取込ログ  | `/aws/vendedlogs/bedrock/knowledgebases/APPLICATION_LOGS/<knowledge-base-id>` |
| Gatewayエラーカスタムメトリクス  | 名前空間：`MAI-LINKs/AgentCore/Gateway`、メトリクス名：`ToolExecutionErrors`               |

